sequenceDiagram
    participant S as "User or GitHub Action"
    participant C as "Sigstore client (Cosign)"
    participant I as "OIDC provider"
    participant F as "Fulcio CA"
    participant R as "Rekor log"

    S->>I: Authenticate identity
    I-->>C: Issue OIDC identity token
    C->>C: Generate ephemeral key pair
    C->>F: Send identity token and public key
    F->>F: Verify OIDC identity
    F-->>C: Issue short-lived certificate
    C->>C: Sign artifact with private key
    C->>R: Upload digest, signature, and certificate
    R-->>C: Return transparency-log proof
    C->>C: Discard ephemeral private key